Telnet client will be found under accessories window.  It's not
a great implementation (lousy for vt100 emulation) but it work.s
If you have a hosts file then you should have no problem using
it.  Otherwise just enter the IP address or name (if you have
the hosts file) and it should telnet you to that system.

If you meant how to telnet INTO	 Windows NT, thats a telnet 
daemon server and it does not come with the oper system.  You 
can get a reasonable telnet server from ataman software (sorry,
look up their web site with a search engine) and then you can
telnet INTO you nt machine.

Hope this helps.

