Between NT 3.5 and NT 3.51 there were changes in the format of the SAM, 
which resulted in appended SAMs when the two are used in the same domain. 
Supposedly, there are no changes to the SAM between NT 4.0 and NT 3.51, 
however, I suspect your problems are related to the compatibility between 
what the NT 4.0 expects and the NT 3.5 offers.

Can you upgrade your NT 3.5 machines to NT 3.51?

Cheers,
Russ

